abstract: "A formalized algorithmic narrative architecture implementing Robert McKee's complete dramatic theory (Story, Dialogue, Storynomics, Character, and Action). Eliminates AI-generated narrative agreeableness (negaphobia) and flaccidity through 5 operational modes: 5-Part Story Structure, 10-Level Dialogue Subtext Decompression, 3-Tier Dimensional Character Architectures, Scene Dynamics Energy Polarity Equations, and McKee Action Set-Piece Engines."
